function syncPanel(){const st=cloud?.state;showSheet('同步與私人配對',`<div class="notice">沿用 Firebase：app1-bd629。瀏覽器有獨立匿名身份，要用原有配對流程接入；唔會自動取得 APK 本機資料。</div><div class="setting-row"><span>備忘</span><span id="cloud-status">${esc(st?.status||'未連線')}</span></div><div class="setting-row"><span>配對</span><span>${st?.members?.length===2?'已配對兩個身份':st?.space?'已建立空間，等待配對':'未配對'}</span></div><div class="setting-row"><span>現金及 SD 卡</span><span>${esc(st?.webStatus||'保存在本機')}</span></div>${st?.queue?.length?`<div class="notice">${st.queue.length} 項待送／衝突操作，原始內容已留喺本機。</div>${st.queue.filter(x=>x.conflict).map(x=>`<div class="panel"><strong>${esc(x.title)}</strong><p>${esc(x.note)}</p>${button('copy-conflict','將本機內容另存副本','plus','secondary',`data-op="${x.op}"`)}</div>`).join('')}`:''}${st?.devices?.map(d=>`<div class="setting-row"><span>${esc(d.name)}${d.id===st.uid?'（本機）':''}</span><small>最近回報 ${fmt(d.lastSeen)}</small></div>`).join('')||''}<div class="button-row" style="margin:20px 0">${button('connect','連接原 Firebase','sync','primary')}${button('retry-sync','重試同步','sync')}${button('invite','產生配對碼','plus','secondary',st?.uid?'':'disabled')}${button('unlink','解除配對','close','secondary',st?.space?'':'disabled')}</div>${field('pair-code','輸入另一部裝置嘅配對碼')}<div class="button-row">${button('join','加入私人空間','arrow','secondary',st?.uid?'':'disabled')}${button('private-scope','切換個人／共用備忘','memo','secondary',st?.space?'':'disabled')}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>現金與 SD 卡共用</h2></div><p>舊規則只容許備忘同步。請先按 ZIP 說明部署新增規則，再啟用。首次接入會檢查兩邊資料，唔會直接覆蓋。</p><div class="button-row">${button('enable-web','啟用共用資料','sync')}${button('resolve-web','合併待確認資料','history')}</div>${localStorage.getItem('pos-web-conflict')?'<div class="notice">有共用資料衝突；本機與遠端副本均已保留。請匯出完整備份並處理，未有靜默覆蓋。</div>':''}`);}
async function loadCloud(){if(!cloud)cloud=await import('./cloud.bundle.mjs');return cloud;}
function adoptRemote(local,remote){for(const r of local.revisions){const match=remote.revisions.find(x=>x.id===r.id&&x.revision===r.revision);if(!match||JSON.stringify(match)!==JSON.stringify(r))throw Error('遠端未包含本機完整歷史；已停止覆蓋');}replay(entries(remote.revisions));return remote;}
async function syncWeb(){if(webBusy||!cloud?.state.web||localStorage.getItem('pos-web-dirty')!=='1')return;webBusy=true;try{let base=Number(localStorage.getItem('pos-web-base')||0);const pending=read('pos-web-packet',null)||{base,op:uuid(),data:{revisions:clone(S.revisions),cards:clone(S.cards)}};localStorage.setItem('pos-web-packet',JSON.stringify(pending));await cloud.saveWeb(pending.data,pending.base,pending.op);localStorage.setItem('pos-web-base',String(pending.base+1));if(JSON.stringify(pending.data)===JSON.stringify({revisions:S.revisions,cards:S.cards}))localStorage.setItem('pos-web-dirty','0');localStorage.removeItem('pos-web-packet');localStorage.removeItem('pos-web-conflict');toast('現金及 SD 卡已獲雲端確認');}catch(e){localStorage.setItem('pos-web-conflict',JSON.stringify(cloud.state.web));toast(e.message);}finally{webBusy=false;}}
window.addEventListener('webdata',async e=>{const r=e.detail;try{const remote=JSON.parse(r.payload),base=Number(localStorage.getItem('pos-web-base')||0);if(localStorage.getItem('pos-web-dirty')==='1'){if(webBusy)return;if(r.version===base)syncWeb();else{localStorage.setItem('pos-web-conflict',JSON.stringify(r));toast('共用資料有更新，請到同步頁合併');}return;}const merged=base>0&&r.version>=base?adoptRemote({revisions:S.revisions,cards:S.cards},remote):mergeWebData({revisions:S.revisions,cards:S.cards},remote);await update(s=>{s.revisions=merged.revisions;s.cards=merged.cards;});localStorage.setItem('pos-web-base',r.version);if(JSON.stringify(merged)!==JSON.stringify(remote)){localStorage.setItem('pos-web-dirty','1');syncWeb();}if(!$('#sheet').open&&!['INPUT','TEXTAREA'].includes(document.activeElement.tagName))render();}catch(err){localStorage.setItem('pos-web-conflict',JSON.stringify(r));toast(err.message);}});
